the movie begins on a flight flying from  Chongqing China to lasa in Tibet Captain  Liu and his co-pilot Kai expected to  make a smooth Landing in about an hour  they are extra careful because the  aircraft is flying at a higher altitude  which causes periodic turbulence  everything is running smoothly until  suddenly the pilots hear a crack and see  that the windshield has been slightly  damaged Liu remains calm and contacts  Air Traffic Control informing them of  their emergency before the operator can  confirm what he heard the crack gets  bigger in less than a second the entire  windshield breaks  foreign  setting off the air pressure in the  cockpit copilot Kai is launched out  through the window and Leo leaps out of  his seat to catch him the scene abruptly  cuts to a few hours earlier Leo is in  the shower holding his breath for as  long as he can he does this every day  and can go more than five minutes  without breathing does this exercise  have a purpose or is it just a sexy game  he plays today is Lee's daughter's  birthday hence he promises to return  home for the party at the end of the day  after he sets off for work we can see  the cabin crew driving to the airport  everyone arrives in a good mood and  starts pre-flight preparations Liu is  flying alongside a fairly new pilot Kai  we are also introduced to the third  pilot Wang they all check their vitals  before meeting the rest of the crew and  discussing the weather conditions and  duration of the flight outside the  passengers wait while the airport staff  does a last minute mechanical check the  flight attendants inspect the emergency  lights oxygen masks number of meals and  such before reporting to the Head  stewardess be non in about 15 minutes  everything is prepared and the  passengers are let onto the craft one of  the flight attendants is bullied by a  rude passenger when she asks him to turn  his phone off he is an internet  celebrity who thinks he's entitled to do  anything because he is above other  passengers on board I hope that guy dies  later be non helps the poor flight  attendant and deals with the passenger  professionally at last the plane takes  off smoothly making everyone believe it  will be a decent flight but little did  they know what is about to come next in  the first half of the flight the plane  experiences heavy turbulence the air  traffic control has already predicted  this considering the change in weather  hence Liu simply calls them and asks for  permission to fly at a higher altitude  where the clouds won't bother them the  passengers on the other hand are calmed  by the flight attendants who do their  job efficiently in some time the  turbulence ends and everyone is relieved  as Leah talks to Kai about his personal  life we find out that he used to be in  the Army before joining the commercial  airlines their conversation halts when  they hear a noise and see the windshield  is cracked slightly they know it is not  a good sign but remain calm and contact  the air traffic control immediately the  operator is about to suggest they go  lower but before they communicate the  windshield breaks completely launching  Kai outside Leo quickly holds him back  and tries to keep him inside the plane  however the pilots struggle Against the  Wind and pressure building in the  cockpit simultaneously the right engine  bursts and stops working unable to take  the load of the airplane now the lives  of 119 passengers and nine crew members  are in the hands of Liu since the doors  to the cockpit are closed the passengers  in the cabin crew outside do not feel  the effect of the pressure change they  experience heavy turbulence but do not  think much of it since it has happened  before everyone is asked to be seated  with their seat belts on while Wang and  binon try to get a hold of the pilots  inside the cockpit when they get no  reply from inside they finally register  that this is not just regular turbulence  in the cockpit Kai is mere seconds away  from being thrown outside the window Liu  pulls himself together and decides to  take control of the plane before trying  to save his co-pilot he jumps back to  his seat tries to contact the operator  again this is even more difficult  because they're flying over the mountain  and the plane can crash into one of them  at any time suddenly the airplane makes  an aggressive right turn Throwing all  the passengers to their side this is  when Panic starts to set in and they  start strapping themselves tightly the  flight attendant helps the kids and  older people on board risking their own  lives for the safety of the passengers  as Leo tries his best to control the  airplane the turbulence only gets worse  then he makes a harsh turn in hopes of  sucking Kai back into the plane the plan  works but it also causes the door to the  cockpit to open the air pressure inside  the entire plane changes as it jerks  backward forcefully a flight attendant  is thrown to the ceiling while she is  trying to help a passenger similarly  everyone else on board is also jerked  forward the oxygen masks drop and the  remaining hostesses help the passengers  wear them when the airplane stabilizes a  bit Wang moves forward trying to get  inside the cockpit to help the others  even the rude passenger from earlier  tries to push him forward when it comes  to his life both Lee you and Kai are  about to pass out when Wang finally  enters the cockpit even in such a  condition leave does his best to keep  the airplane in control holding his  breath as much as he can Wang makes the  captains wear oxygen masks which helps  them a bit and they are able to punch in  numbers to get the plane to a lower  altitude I wish my wang was this heroic  somewhere else in the air traffic  control office chaos ensues when they  see the plane descending at a  frightening rate the communication with  the pilots is also cut off which is a  clear hint that something has gone  terribly wrong they inform the other  offices to make room for the flight's  emergency landing several flights are  canceled all across East Asia because of  a chain reaction in addition firemen  paramedics and many other emergency  workers are sent to nearby airports to  prepare for a landing the control room  also sends three fighter jets in search  of the plane while the pilots flying  them try to contact Liu through their  respective radios the people on the  ground do everything they can to find to  the plane and ensure the safety of the  passengers and crew but in the end it  comes down to the pilots to save  everyone's lives the door to the cockpit  is now locked stabilizing the situation  on board the passengers are in a frenzy  but they remain seated as ordered by the  flight attendants benon comes forward to  confirm the positions of her team asking  them to press the call button on the  ceiling when their names are called  everyone responds to their name one  after another except for the last flight  attendant who had been slammed into the  ceiling earlier the others try to wake  her up repeatedly and are about to give  up when she suddenly raises her hand  affirming that she is still alive her  team's size with relief and watches her  pull herself together into a seat they  are proud of her for holding herself up  but the situation requires them to focus  on the matter at hand at the moment  benon then announces that they have lost  cabin pressure and requests everyone to  stay seated with their seat belts and  oxygen masks on meanwhile Wang removes  his mask to yell into the microphone  against the air hitting him through the  broken windshield his efforts do not go  to waste as people on the ground hear  about the depressurized cockpit the  operator reveals that the plane needs to  descend below 3000 meters to gain enough  oxygen but the mountains below them have  an average height of 4 500 meters this  means they have to cross the entire  Plateau without crashing into any  mountains in order to survive with only  one engine working and a depressurized  cockpit it is almost impossible to  achieve such a goal in the next hour the  news about the airplane makes it to the  internet friends and family of people on  board start panicking trying to find as  much information as they can the plane  should have landed by now so the people  coming to pick up their family members  start blaming the airport employees for  keeping them in the dark in the meantime  trouble adds up when a thick cloud  formation blocks the airplane from going  forward flying above the clouds is not  an option but flying directly into the  storm would be inviting death itself  this is when the passengers lose their  cool and start revolting a drunk man  gets up from his seat yelling at a  crying child to stop when the flight  attendants ask him to calm down he  pushes her aside demanding to know what  is going on he also Rams a food trolley  into another flight attendant hurting  her Gravely benon comes to the scene  urging him to trust their Captain the  only person who can save them at this  point the other passengers join her  making the drunk man get back to his  seat and shut the hell up meanwhile in  the cockpit Wang tries to keep the  pilots warm while they fly the plane in  circles trying to avoid the storm on the  ground Liu's wife is preparing for her  daughter's birthday party she is shocked  upon seeing the news about the airplane  but she is positive that her husband  will bring the plane back she also  assures her daughter that Lou will be  back before she knows it and they will  celebrate her birthday together at the  same time Liu's mind goes hazy and he  imagines his daughter cutting a birthday  cake the vision gets more Vivid as he  slowly loses Consciousness posing a  great threat to the entire plane Wang  comes behind the captain and shakes him  to wake him up properly if the situation  continues everyone on board will fall  unconscious the plane will continue  moving on autopilot and eventually crash  when it runs out of fuel after making  several circles Lou finally sees what he  was way 4 a tiny pathway is cleared  between the clouds that he can fly the  plane through people from the control  room praise His quick thinking and watch  as the plane flies into the dark clouds  the turbulence gets worse and Luggage  starts falling from the compartments  overhead the control room watches the  flight nervously until it suddenly goes  off the radar everything goes silent as  they assume that it crashed but their  prayers work and we see the passengers  are still alive somewhere between the  clouds the captain pulls a lever  propelling the plane forward with all of  his might several minutes of silence  later chatter continues in the control  room when the plane comes back on the  radar but although it got out of the  storm it is completely tilted and  nowhere near stabilized the safety of  119 passengers repeats in Liu's mind  again and again preventing him from  passing out at any minute at last the  airplane passes the clouds and the  turbulence ends after seeing death up  close the passengers start confessing  their darkest secrets to each other a  husband tells his wife that he lied to  her about his job but she forgives him  instantly he also tells her he's a furry  and she's confused many other people  make last videos for their loved ones  hoping to say goodbye to them in the  following scene the plane finally  reaches the altitude where there is  enough oxygen and the pilots take off  their masks for a better view the  connection to the control room is  re-established and they are told where  to land every other flight around the  airport is halted and landed immediately  inside the aircraft passengers and the  crew get ready for an emergency landing  while outside the reporters get ready to  capture The Descent seconds before they  land the passengers are fueled with a  will to live they all chant encouraging  words and Brace themselves for the  impact the plane finally touches down  but keeps moving towards the end of the  runway everyone is worried that it will  crash but at the last second all three  Pilots pull the lever collectively  making it come to a halt when the  suspense ends The Operators jump in  celebration but the passengers are so  overwhelmed that they break into tears  Liu talks to the speaker and apologizes  to everyone for the inconvenience in  turn the passengers collectively give  him a thumbs up thanking him for saving  their lives after everyone gets off the  airplane an officer from the management  Bureau comes in to investigate the  malfunction it turns out that the  cockpit had not been pressurized  properly because the aircraft was old  upon seeing the condition it is in the  officer calls Lou an incredible pilot  and thanks him for his work Lou gives  his family a call telling them he will  be home soon he is interrupted though  because of a noise outside which turns  out to be the passengers shouting to  thank him Captain Leo and a few other  cabin crew members bow to the passengers  to express their gratitude the movie  ends as the passengers from Sichuan  Airlines meet their family and friends  thankful for the miracle that just  happened to them finally we are shown  pictures of the actual cabin crew who  experienced this incident in May of 2018  pictures of the real Sichuan Airlines  flight 8633 after the incident are also  shown subscribe for more videos like  this turn on notifications and leave a  like to help the channel out thank you  for watching

